%% Collaboration 06: Fraud Detection Response
flowchart LR
  TxnStream["Transaction Stream"]
  FraudEngine["Fraud Engine"]
  CaseMgr["Case Management"]
  OpsConsole["Operations Console"]
  CoreAPI["Core Banking API"]
  NotifySvc["Notification Service"]
  AuditSvc["Audit Service"]

  TxnStream -->|high-value transaction event| FraudEngine
  FraudEngine -->|open suspicious case| CaseMgr
  CaseMgr -->|assign investigation task| OpsConsole
  OpsConsole -->|investigation disposition| CaseMgr
  CaseMgr -->|block/release command| CoreAPI
  CoreAPI -->|execution result| CaseMgr
  CaseMgr -->|customer outcome event| NotifySvc
  NotifySvc -.->|customer alert| OpsConsole
  CaseMgr -->|forensic evidence and timeline| AuditSvc
